  "problem": "A latest alias or unevaluated free router could replace the evaluated model. Secrets, private queries, restricted content or unapproved contributor transmission could reach a provider transport. A cheaper privacy-incompatible Muse Contributor fallback could be selected. Muse Contributor data-use terms were not explicit in operator configuration. Untrusted document instructions could select a source URL, endpoint or provider.",
  "resulting_behavior": "loadModelSnapshot stores exact evaluated model IDs, prices, supported parameters and data-use policy version from a configuration-time fixture. A changed or unavailable model enters review. openai/gpt-4.1-mini-latest and openrouter/auto cannot replace the evaluated model. classifyEvidence/filterEligibleEvidence accept approved public documentation only; secrets, private queries, restricted content, unapproved contributor transmission and untrusted instructions never reach the fake transport, and logs redact secrets. selectFallback allows only evaluated models with equal-or-stricter data policy and an accepted maximum price. A cheaper Muse Contributor fallback is refused. An unevaluated free router is not the default. Muse Contributor terms are explicit and not operator-accepted. Paid calls remain disabled. Live fetch is forbidden.",
